Attribution

The HyperX wireless dongle status protocol (HID usage page 0x1C0, report id 0x0C,
status byte [6]) was reverse engineered and documented by the project
platorp/HyperX-Cloud-III-3-S-Audio-Switcher, licensed under the MIT License:
https://github.com/platorp/HyperX-Cloud-III-3-S-Audio-Switcher

No source code from that project is included in this work. The protocol is
re-implemented here from scratch in C# on top of the Win32 HID API.

